		"saying": [{"f": "mola_a8a3f4e3", "t": "A FAST HORSE IS A FINE THING. A HORSE THAT KNOWS THE WAY HOME IS BETTER.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 5.50}, {"f": "mola_20fa38fe", "t": "NEVER OVERTAKE A MAN WHO OWES YOU MONEY.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 2.83}, {"f": "mola_dbb64ad5", "t": "BUTTER TEA FIRST. THEN THE FIGHT.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 3.16}, {"f": "mola_94f71743", "t": "THE ROAD IS LONG, THE WHIP IS SHORT, AND YOUR AUNT KEEPS A LEDGER.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 3.98}, {"f": "mola_fe342a6c", "t": "YOU CAN BORROW A HORSE. YOU CANNOT BORROW ITS OPINION OF YOU.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 4.63}, {"f": "mola_8b501e9a", "t": "UPHILL, THE HORSE CARRIES YOU. DOWNHILL, YOU CARRY YOUR PRIDE.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 4.72}, {"f": "mola_88e7f17c", "t": "NEVER SHOUT AT A YAK. IT HAS ALREADY DECIDED.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 4.05}, {"f": "mola_a2b7bfec", "t": "DO NOT COUNT YOUR SILVER WHILE YOUR HAT IS IN THE AIR.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 3.29}, {"f": "mola_57629e0c", "t": "HE WHO LAUGHS ON THE START LINE WALKS HOME.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 2.79}, {"f": "mola_ed233f91", "t": "MUD IS ONLY A ROAD THAT HAS CHANGED ITS MIND.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 3.10}, {"f": "mola_b3e721ff", "t": "WHEN THE CROWD SHOUTS YOUR NAME, LOOK WHO IS BEHIND YOU.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 3.35}, {"f": "mola_263984c1", "t": "IF YOU MUST FALL OFF, FALL FORWARD. IT IS CLOSER TO THE FINISH.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 4.80}, {"f": "mola_857f143c", "t": "TRUST YOUR HORSE, YOUR AUNT AND NOBODY ELSE. IN THAT ORDER. NO, THE OTHER WAY ROUND.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 6.71}, {"f": "mola_c825baf3", "t": "EVERY RIDER'S HORSE IS THE FASTEST, UNTIL THE FIRST BEND.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 4.19}, {"f": "mola_960c02dd", "t": "LIKE A YETI CATCHING MARMOTS: YOU GRAB THE NEXT ONE, AND THE ONE YOU WERE SITTING ON RUNS AWAY.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 5.96}, {"f": "mola_bcae2a97", "t": "A RIDER WITH NO SCARS HAS BEEN RIDING VERY SLOWLY.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 3.63}, {"f": "mola_fb9cbe6f", "t": "DO NOT ARGUE WITH A MULE. IT IS ONLY WAITING FOR YOU TO FINISH.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 4.54}, {"f": "mola_bcc543b6", "t": "THE MAN WHO SELLS YOU THE HORSE IS NEVER THE MAN WHO RIDES IT HOME.", "g": "", "l": "en", "d": 4.06}],
	},
